name: sim.isDeprecated
description: Deprecated (yes, what an irony!). Returns 0
luaSynopsis: int result=sim.isDeprecated(string funcOrConst)
pythonSynopsis: int result=sim.isDeprecated(string funcOrConst)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. funcOrConst: a script function or constant
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. -1 in case of an error, otherwise the deprecation state (0 or 1)
